    "captured_text": "40K.APP\nFACTIONS\nAELDARI\nWave Serpent\nDATASHEET\nUPDATES\nMODELS\nM\nT\nSV\nW\nLD\nOC\nWave Serpent Large Flying Base\n\nInvulnerable save: 5+\n\n14\"\n9\n3+\n13\n7+\n2\nRANGED WEAPONS\nRNG\nA\nBS\nS\nAP\nD\nShuriken cannon\nLETHAL HITS\n24\"\n3\n3+\n6\n-1\n2\nTwin bright lance\nTWIN-LINKED\n36\"\n1\n3+\n12\n-3\nD6+2\n➤ Twin missile launcher (starshot)\nTWIN-LINKED\n48\"\n1\n3+\n10\n-2\nD6\n➤ Twin missile launcher (sunburst)\nBLAST\nTWIN-LINKED\n48\"\nD6\n3+\n4\n-1\n1\nTwin scatter laser\nTWIN-LINKED\nSUSTAINED HITS 1\n36\"\n6\n3+\n5\n0\n1\nTwin shuriken cannon\nLETHAL HITS\nTWIN-LINKED\n24\"\n3\n3+\n6\n-1\n2\nTwin shuriken catapult\nASSAULT\nTWIN-LINKED\n18\"\n2\n3+\n4\n-1\n1\nTwin starcannon\nTWIN-LINKED\n36\"\n2\n3+\n8\n-3\n2\nMELEE WEAPONS\nA\nWS\nS\nAP\nD\nWraithbone hull\n3\n4+\n6\n0\n1\nKEYWORDS\nAELDARI\nDEDICATED TRANSPORT\nFLY\nFRAME\nTRANSPORT\nVEHICLE\nWAVE SERPENT\nCOSTS\n1 model\n115 pts\n4th+ in your army\n+10 pts\nUNIT COMPOSITION\n1 Wave Serpent\n\nThis model is equipped with: twin shuriken cannon; twin shuriken catapult; wraithbone hull.\n\nBecome a supporter and remove ads\nWARGEAR OPTIONS\nThis model’s twin shuriken cannon can be replaced with one of the following: ◦ 1 twin missile launcher ◦ 1 twin bright lance ◦ 1 twin scatter laser ◦ 1 twin starcannon\nThis model’s twin shuriken catapult can be replaced with 1 shuriken cannon.\nCORE ABILITIES\nDEADLY DEMISE D3\nFACTION ABILITIES\nBATTLE FOCUS\nUNIT ABILITIES\nWave Serpent Shield\n\nEach time a ranged attack targets this model, if the Strength characteristic of that attack is greater than the Toughness characteristic of this model, subtract 1 from the Wound roll.\n\nTRANSPORT\n\nThis model has a transport capacity of 12 ASURYANI INFANTRY models. Each WRAITH CONSTRUCT model takes the space of 2 models. It cannot transport JUMP PACK models or YNNARI models (excluding ASURYANI, YVRAINE and THE VISARCH models).\n\nDAMAGED: 1-4 WOUNDS REMAINING\n\nWhile this model has 1-4 wounds remaining, each time this model makes an attack, subtract 1 from the Hit roll.\n\nSTATS\n23%\nof Aeldari lists, 1.3 per list\n#13\nmost-taken in faction\n29%\nfrom 23% since last update\nIN ARMY LISTS\nPopular detachments\nARMOURED WARHOST\nASPECT HOST\nSPIRIT CONCLAVE\nOften taken with\nFIRE DRAGONS\nWARP SPIDERS\nHOWLING BANSHEES\nWRAITHLORD\nSPIRITSEER"
